WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.072
The assessment has two parts.

00:00:02.072 --> 00:00:10.562
First, create analytics dot vw employee department info with employee name, salary, and department name.

00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:13.252
Second, use only that view to calculate the average salary for Sales.

00:00:13.252 --> 00:00:16.267
The point is not only the syntax.

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:24.287
You should also state the grain and explain why the view is a reusable interface.

00:00:24.287 --> 00:00:26.067
For this activity, make a prediction before you run anything.

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:31.897
State what one output row should represent, which records you expect to remain,

00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:37.737
and what edge case is most likely to expose a mistake.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:42.207
Then run the SQL and compare the result with that prediction.

00:00:42.207 --> 00:00:49.317
If it does not match, debug the logic in small pieces instead of changing several clauses at once.

00:00:49.317 --> 00:00:53.602
This is the same habit you would use in a real analytics project:

00:00:53.602 --> 00:00:58.149
validate the meaning of the result, not only whether the statement executes.
